WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Hello! Welcome to our sample video.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
This is a demo subtitle for English language.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Enjoy watching the bunny animation!

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The bunny is getting ready to jump.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Look at those fluffy ears!

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Did you know bunnies can hop really high?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Watch as this one leaps across the screen.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
What an energetic little creature!

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Now it’s sniffing around, looking curious.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Bunnies love to explore their surroundings.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Did you spot the carrot in the corner?

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Let’s see if the bunny finds it.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
There it goes—chomp chomp!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Such a happy little bunny.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Now it's time for a playful roll.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Look at that! So cute and fluffy.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.000
The background music makes it even better.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.000
This is a perfect short break video.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Let’s slow things down a bit now.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The bunny is getting sleepy.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Yawning and stretching its paws.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Time for a cozy little nap.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Soft breathing and gentle music.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.000
The bunny dreams of fields and flowers.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.000
What a peaceful sight.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.000
We hope you're enjoying the calm vibes.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Let's stay with the bunny a bit longer.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.000
It's slowly waking up now.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.000
A little stretch and shake.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Time to hop around again!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Here comes a little dance.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Bunny hops left, then right.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.000
What a cheerful moment!

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Do you feel more relaxed now?

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:45.000
We’re almost at the end of the video.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Let’s give the bunny a round of applause!

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.000
Thanks for watching with us.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.000
See you in the next animation!

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.000
Have a great day ahead!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Don't forget to smile like the bunny!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Stay fluffy and kind!

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.000
Bye bye from the bunny and friends!

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.000
Waving a little paw goodbye.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.000
The screen fades to white...

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.000
...with soft music playing in the background.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.000
Credits roll gently on screen.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.000
Created with love and fluff.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Thank you for your time!

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.000
See you soon in another cute adventure.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.000
The End.